{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In turbulent times, force becomes the standard to measure strength, as a front mercenary, you will have your own base, and step by step upgrade your own armory and logistics facilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-02-15.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the weapon most frequently used by mercenaries when they kill or are killed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the &quot;Battle Agreement&quot;, the main weapon will be unlimited</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-31-01.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I believe that you natural fighters can judge the performance of these weapons from the name, but in fact, more than that, each weapon can be modified and upgraded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-35-22.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-36-55.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you feel that the ordinary modification is not strong enough, maybe some of the leaders have materials that can change the performance of the weapon, belike:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-52-36.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sub weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game where the secondary weapon caliber is never larger than the main weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-39-47.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Correspondingly, secondary weapons can still be modified and upgraded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-45-34.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-45-27.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling like you don't have enough secondary weapons or caliber?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is where the next piece of armaments comes in:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armor will drastically change the way of fighting, and will provide companion weapons, the time is now, I must immediately pull out my faster fire/hit higher caliber/larger caliber/range of damage/with sputter/ignore cover/automatic enemy secondary weapons and start shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-49-38.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-56-31.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not recommended to use Foehn armor if it rains in the mission zone, otherwise the operation may be somewhat difficult</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foehn armor should be used in Foehn weather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-49-55.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if the enemy likes to hide in the side of the bunker and play tactics with guns?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then start the barbecue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boom B weapons go through walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-39-47.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The projectile weapon can also be modified and upgraded, in addition to the basic performance enhancement, there are some unclear principles of the upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Don't ask what's in the jar.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-06-42.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an armed force whose principle is unclear, the combat protocol is the most crucial existence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">agreement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat protocols are applied to combat as passive effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It should be noted that the enemy will counter by [mirror] activating some combat protocols that we have not activated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for a sudden burn under your feet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-51-43.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-51-34.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-51-48.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using the horst as a base, the mercenaries will travel to three combat zones for missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The Front Line</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on tasks, meet goals, and get paid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-38-34.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare before you go into battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's raining outside. Take an umbrella</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_10-57-59.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-42-48.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-45-10.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Survivor simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mercenaries will perform consciousness dives in medical silos, hone themselves in endless battles, and gain powers beyond the battle protocol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-49-29.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-51-47.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-49-59.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Counterplan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an arm independent of the combat protocol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will help the mercenaries fight against more difficult enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-43-25.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-43-51.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Travel hinterland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep into the enemy's hinterland, where enemy units are equipped with energy shields, even with combat protocols and countermeasures, frontal combat is still not a wise choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In that case, remove the slugging protocol, and activate the infiltration protocol that makes it impossible for the enemy to mark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mode, the enemy can only sense the mercenary by sight and sound, infiltrate the stronghold, disable the shield generator, and then use the silenced pistol to kill the defenseless and unprotected enemy from behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-16-51.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And beware of mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-24-40.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the loss of the role of the battle agreement, ammunition is no longer unlimited, the mercenaries need to use local materials, take the enemy to eat the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-21-40.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hideouts outside the strongholds provide more secure access to resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-34-08.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the time is right, the mercenaries will travel to the heart of the hinterland, using all the resources they have accumulated before, to challenge and destroy the Apocalypse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-39-47.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-41-54.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-42-15.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-46-28.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-46-43.png?t=1745459193\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3438760?t=1745459193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3438760?t=1745459193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/7ec9a6e4ca94ed166fd100946e77d1e96ce7e899/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745459193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/7ec9a6e4ca94ed166fd100946e77d1e96ce7e899/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745459193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{