em_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_11-49-59.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Counterplan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an arm independent of the combat protocol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will help the mercenaries fight against more difficult enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-43-25.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_09-43-51.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Travel hinterland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep into the enemy's hinterland, where enemy units are equipped with energy shields, even with combat protocols and countermeasures, frontal combat is still not a wise choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In that case, remove the slugging protocol, and activate the infiltration protocol that makes it impossible for the enemy to mark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mode, the enemy can only sense the mercenary by sight and sound, infiltrate the stronghold, disable the shield generator, and then use the silenced pistol to kill the defenseless and unprotected enemy from behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-16-51.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And beware of mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-24-40.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the loss of the role of the battle agreement, ammunition is no longer unlimited, the mercenaries need to use local materials, take the enemy to eat the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-21-40.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hideouts outside the strongholds provide more secure access to resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-34-08.png?t=1745459193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the time is right, the mercenaries will travel to the heart of the hinterland, using all the resources they have accumulated before, to challenge and destroy the Apocalypse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-39-47.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-41-54.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-42-15.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-46-28.png?t=1745459193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-06_12-46-43.png?t=1745459193\" /></p>","developers":["little wood"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438760/header.jpg?t=1745459193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b